OL,3,GNEWSAPub attacker's sentence cut after
OL,4,Acourt brawl
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Jeremy Richardson KC told Neeson,
OL,7,Fwho sported a bloodied face as he stood
OL,8,Fin the dock, he had reduced the amount
OL,9,Fof time he would spend in jail as an
OL,10,F"act of mercy" following the
OL,11,F"outrageous" attack.
